KG42.register("clusters-8f0f0116a27d98614612479c",{"id":"11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation::v142-d-K001","paper":"11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation","label":"Participation eligibility and product boundaries for local electrical energy sharing within an ESR","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-K001","label":"Participation eligibility and product boundaries for local electrical energy sharing within an ESR","market_meaning":"Prosumers may share surplus electricity within an ESR formed by a microgrid or part of a distribution network, and consumers without local generation may also participate; the shared product is local electrical energy within that region.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["participation","bidding"],"scope_disposition":"compatible","scope_explanation":"The three chains jointly delimit the participants and the shared product and are all registered under the general P2P framework of M01. The source's collective designation of consumers as prosumers is a terminological convention; it does not mean that the two participation nodes can be merged, nor does it constitute a complete regional admission regime.","assembly_status":"assembled","boundary_rationale":"The participants, the sharing activities in which they may participate, and the geographical scope of the product jointly form an independent definition of eligibility and the product; bid calculation, pricing, and settlement are assembled separately.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R006","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Clarifies that consumers without local generation may still participate in sharing."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R007","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Provides the participation scope for prosumers sharing surplus generation and explains the use of prosumers as a collective designation that includes consumers."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R009","ownership":"primary","role":"support","rationale":"Delimits the local electrical energy product and ESR scope involved in the participation activities described above."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-CN01","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R006","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R007","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C001","v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e02","v141-b-g01-e03","v141-b-g01-e04"],"rationale":"The source explicitly includes consumers and subsequently uses prosumers as a collective designation; the two chains separately retain their applicability to participants with and without generation and do not treat the participation nodes as the same object."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-CN02","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R007","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R009","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e03","v141-b-g01-e05","v141-b-g02-e04"],"rationale":"The prosumer sharing activity and the definition of local electrical energy refer to the same ESR context and provide complementary explanations of who may share and which product is shared; no regional admission edge is added on this basis."}],"object_mappings":[],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-K001-G01","category":"unverified_source","description":"The participation definition and ESR description come from candidate evidence permitted for use in the experiment, and their source_status remains unverified; the procedural completeness of this cluster does not mean that the sources have been independently verified.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R006","v141-c-R007","v141-c-R009"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001","v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C002","v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e02","v141-b-g01-e03","v141-b-g01-e04","v141-b-g01-e05","v141-b-g02-e04"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Subsequently, independently check the participation definition and ESR scope in Section 3.1, and manually confirm that the collective terminology does not change the meanings of the two frozen participation nodes."}]},"rule_refs":["11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation::v141-c-R006","11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation::v141-c-R007","11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation::v141-c-R009"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-c6917f781ea3f39e","COMP-f66e9ec7493cbb66","KG31-c53b1d455f59fded"]});
